    "sentence_translations": [
      "Dyeing Your Hair",
      "",
      "Little Ming noticed his dad dyeing his hair at home, and asked:",
      "“Dad, it's normal to have white hair when you're old. Why do you have to dye it? Are you trying to find a girlfriend?”",
      "Dad said: “Every time just before we visit your grandma, I color my hair black.”",
      "“That way your grandma will see me and think I'm still young, and that she hasn't grown old yet.”"
    ]
